  Authority: AAP §0.4.1 (file inventory enumerates this filename),
  §0.2.2 (Metrics 8, 9, 11 align with the DORA framework — Change Failure
  Rate ≈ Problem Records & Escaped Defects; Deployment Frequency ≈
  Releases), §0.2.3 (no GITHUB_TOKEN → Metric 9 Insufficient signal;
  no retrievable CI test artifacts → Metric 11 Insufficient signal),
  §0.7.1 Rule 5 (content-slide constraints — max 4 bullets, ≤40 body
  words, ≥1 non-text visual, zero emoji, no fenced code blocks),
  §0.7.2.1 (canonical phrasing "Insufficient signal — [reason]" when
  data is lacking; MUST NOT fabricate or extrapolate), §0.7.2.2 Rule 3
  (Confidence Transparency — every derived metric carries a tag AND
  every Low / Insufficient-signal metric carries an explicit caveat;
